OL,3,GNEWSASexual misconduct cases at
OL,4,Aambulance service double
OL,5,
OL,6,FReported cases of misogyny and sexual
OL,7,Fmisconduct at an ambulance service more
OL,8,Fthan doubled year-on-year, with 156
OL,9,Fcases reported since April 2024.
OL,11,FSackings over "sexual safety" cases
OL,12,Fhave also more than quadrupled, with 25
OL,13,Fdismissals in 2025-2026 alone, said the
OL,14,FEast of England Ambulance Service.
OL,16,FIt said figures were reflective of a
OL,17,Fgrowing awareness and increased
OL,18,Fconfidence in reporting - rather than
OL,19,Fan increasing number of incidents.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
